{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261109/photo/bkn-20261109082101708-1109_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261109084632\"/><p>大樹倒塌壓毀私家車。</p><p>西貢有樹木倒塌。今晨(9日)7時27分，一輛私家車沿西貢公路往九龍方向行駛，至近白沙灣對開時，路邊一棵10米高的大樹突然倒塌，私家車閃避不及導致右前方車身及車輪損毀。事件中，私家車司機無受傷並自行報案，倒塌的樹木橫亘現場來回方向兩條行車線，救援人員接報到場處理事件，現場來回方向交通一度受阻。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.656326+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T00:21:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T11:36:38.486032+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T10:15:45.110906+00:00","content_hash":"8540949c21b685cc8e043b3ea86eaf28b3ecf04fae758be1769870723b764d43","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.656326+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}